318
00:37:51,553 --> 00:37:51,553
Optogenetics activates or silences specific neurons with light, like a switchboard operator for consciousness.

319
00:37:51,553 --> 00:37:51,553
At the systems level: brain-computer interfaces are routing around damaged circuits entirely.

320
00:37:51,553 --> 00:37:51,553
A.I.-designed drugs are replacing the pharmaceutical industry's ancient method of "try thousands of molecules and see what

321
00:37:51,553 --> 00:37:51,553
