322
00:37:51,553 --> 00:37:51,553
That's the difference between performing surgery with a rock and performing surgery with a laser.

323
00:37:51,553 --> 00:37:51,553
None of these are finished. All of them are proof that the prison has doors.

324
00:37:51,553 --> 00:37:51,553
The endgame isn't making humans obedient. It's making humans *free*.

325
00:37:51,553 --> 00:37:51,553
For the first time in two hundred thousand years, you could actually choose what you value instead of having a Pleistocene

326
00:37:51,553 --> 00:37:51,553
survival algorithm choose for you. Your Christians could finally feel the same warm glow from feeding the hungry that they

327
00:37:51,553 --> 00:37:51,553
currently feel from feeding themselves. Your economists could finally care about the long term, because their brains would

328
00:37:51,553 --> 00:37:51,553
stop treating next quarter as the heat death of the universe.

329
00:37:51,553 --> 00:37:51,553
Your voters could finally evaluate policy on evidence instead of vibes, because the amygdala would stop hijacking every

330
00:37:51,553 --> 00:37:51,553
decision that involves a stranger. Not because you became angels.

331
00:37:51,553 --> 00:37:51,553
Because you finally got the admin password to the machine that was preventing you from being anything other than sophisticated

332
00:37:51,553 --> 00:37:51,553
apes with car keys. On Wishonia, this is what happened. Altruism stopped being sacrifice and became appetite.

333
00:37:51,553 --> 00:37:51,553
Self-control stopped being a war with yourself and became a preference setting.

334
00:37:51,553 --> 00:37:51,553
The selfish gene is still selfish. They just stopped letting it drive.

335
00:37:51,553 --> 00:37:51,553
And that, more than any cure for any disease, is the real reason to fund biotechnology: it's the only path to genuine freedom

336
00:37:51,553 --> 00:37:51,553
your species has ever had. Every other liberation movement in human history freed you from external chains.

337
00:37:51,553 --> 00:37:51,553
This one frees you from internal ones. The ones you didn't even know you were wearing, because they were installed before

338
00:37:51,553 --> 00:37:51,553
